# P12 round 7: the Synth play page on the Tracker Mini (no Perform key, no pads). Menu box 12 ("Synth Play", Up then Left from the Pattern box)
# opens the page the way Shift + Perform does on Tracker+, Middle held plays C4 through the page's router and lets go of it, a second press holds
# it for the shot, the release ends it. Menu on the page shows the popup on the Synth Play box, Right and Up x2 go to the Pattern box, the
# release leaves the page. plus_flows.sh reads the page state afterwards (UISHOT_TRACE_SPLAY): open with mode 5 and only part A voiced,
# a held C4 cell, then none, and the last line closed with the MIDI in mode back.
# Replay: plus_flows.sh mini
title: Synth play page on the Mini (P12)
check: texts
pause: 90ms

wait 1500ms
press Menu
wait 400ms
tap Up
wait 300ms
tap Left
wait 300ms
shot menubox
release Menu
wait 1200ms
expect text "Synth A"
expect text "Bank A"
hold Mid 600ms
wait 400ms
press Mid
wait 500ms
shot splay
release Mid
wait 500ms
press Menu
wait 400ms
tap Right
wait 300ms
tap Up x2
wait 300ms
release Menu
wait 1200ms
